# Cybersecurity Fundamentals

This folder contains my learning notes and understanding of basic cybersecurity concepts, threats and security practices.

## Topics Covered

- Introduction to Cybersecurity
- CIA Triad (Confidentiality, Integrity and Availability)
- Authentication and Authorization
- Encryption and Decryption
- Hashing
- Phishing and Social Engineering
- Malware and Common Cyber Threats
- Firewalls and Network Security
- Vulnerability Management
- Security Best Practices

## Learning Objectives

- Understand the fundamentals of information security.
- Identify common cybersecurity threats.
- Learn basic security principles.
- Understand methods used to protect systems and information.

## Purpose
To build a strong foundation in cybersecurity through continuous learning and practical exploration.

